    "steps": [ { "cast": "Grasping Shadows // Shadows' Lair" }, { "resolve": true }, { "attack": [ { "card": "Hill Giant", "at": "p1" }, { "card": "Grizzly Bears", "at": "p1" } ] }, { "block": [] } ],
    "expect": { "players": [ {}, {} ], "keywords": { "Hill Giant": [] } } },
 { "name": "third dread counter transforms it; the Lair's {B},{T}, remove a dread counter draws a card and costs 1 life",
